 "offset_seconds": -5.540000000000138,
 "words_heard": 248,
 "words": 250,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "I told him even if they all fall away, Lord, I never will",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 1.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Even if I must die with you, I'd be standing with you still",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 2.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He looked at me and told me what this very night would bring",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 3.06,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Before the rooster crows, you will deny me three times",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 7.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "They led him to the high priest's house, I followed far behind",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 5.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "They kindled a fire in the courtyard and I sat down in the light",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 6.95,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "A servant girl looked close at me and said this man was with him too",
   "heard": 15,
   "words": 15,
   "error_s": 8.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I said woman, I don't know him, and I didn't know what to do",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 13.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Before the rooster crows",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 15.03,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Before the rooster crows",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 15.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "You will deny me three times",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 18.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And he went outside and wept bitterly",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 18.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "A little later someone said, you are one of them too",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 21.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I said man, I am not, I don't know what you're talking to",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 29.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "An hour later, your accent gives you away, they swore",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 34.01,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And I began to curse and swear, I do not know the man, no more",
   "heard": 15,
   "words": 15,
   "error_s": 41.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Before the rooster crows",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 42.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Before the rooster crows",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 52.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "You will deny me three times",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 57.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And he went outside and wept bitterly",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 58.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "At that very moment, while he was still speaking, the rooster crowed",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.9,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The Lord turned and looked straight at Peter",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And Peter remembered the word the Lord had spoken",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Three times I said I never knew him",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.94,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The one who knew me best of all",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
